The {{PAGENAME}} is a [[Curiosity]] which can be used in the [[Study Report]] to earn [[Learning Points]]. Interestingly enough, it is alive. If you drop it, it will run at roughly the same speed as an [[Itsy Bitsy Spider]]. Don't drop it outside!

==How to Acquire==

Obtained when crafting a [[Cone Cow]] using an [[Unusually Large Hop Cone]].

==Quality==

A {{PAGENAME}}'s quality is [[softcap|softcap]]ped by the [[Survival]] skill.

